  "description": "Among those born with wings, \"The Duke of Dominica\" Lee Yeon-ji, a timid high school girl with unusual wings. Boy, who always has a positive personality, the beautiful wings of his friend, Jahee. Yeon-ji, who didn't want her shabby wings to be compared all the time, On the first day of high school, an accidental incident It will be a new tube planner, modified and a garland. To earn 50 million won for surgery to remove wings, On a fixed-term basis, we pledge to do new tubes with Sujeong and Gwanjong Jaehee. to remove wings, a complex wing, While thinking about the irony of exposing it to new tubes, Yeon-ji meets Hong Tae-jun, a male student in the mystery volleyball team, I'm getting caught up in an unknown incident...!\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EC%A0%9C%EB%B9%84%EA%B0%80-%EB%82%AE%EA%B2%8C-%EB%82%A0%EB%A9%B4/3047), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/60798762)",
